## 🛡️ Add CodeQL Security Analysis Workflow

### Overview

This pull request adds a GitHub CodeQL security-analysis workflow to the
Biometric Fraud Detection Project.

The workflow is designed to provide automated static security analysis of
the project's Python source code and integrate security checks directly
into the pull-request and main-branch development lifecycle.

### Security Coverage

The workflow will:

- Analyze Python source code with GitHub CodeQL
- Use the `security-extended` query suite
- Run automatically on pull requests targeting `main`
- Run automatically on pushes to `main`
- Perform a scheduled weekly security analysis
- Publish CodeQL findings through GitHub Code Scanning

### Workflow

```text
Pull Request / Push
        ↓
GitHub Actions
        ↓
CodeQL Initialization
        ↓
Python Security Analysis
        ↓
Security-Extended Queries
        ↓
Code Scanning Results
        ↓
Review / Remediation
